Analysis Situs v2026.1.1 (commit 3c3ec3ff) for OCCT 7.9.3 and WebAssembly: the port the
kernel build applies to the vendored files (build-asi.sh), 14 files. No algorithm changes.
* OCCT 7.8 changed the hasher protocol of its NCollection maps. Each old-style hasher gets
  ASI_OCCT78_HASHER(key) from asi_occt79_compat.h (force-included), the removed
  Standard_GUID::HashCode / IsEqual calls become the compat header's globals, maps keyed by
  Standard_GUID drop their hasher argument, and asiAlgo_DiscrSequenceOfPointer.h gets a
  hasher of its own.
* ASI_NO_VIS_IO: no windowing system, offscreen rendering or STL reading and writing in
  asiAlgo_Utils.cpp (those functions report failure).
* ASI_NO_EIGEN: no Eigen include; asiAlgo_Utils::InterpolatePoints returns false.
* Speed, same answers: asiAlgo_CheckDihedralAngle::AngleBetweenFaces reads its cached edge
  maps of the two faces in place instead of copying both for every face pair (the copies
  made building the adjacency graph quadratic in the edges of a face).
These hunks change Analysis Situs files and are under those files' licence (BSD-3-Clause:
LICENSES/AnalysisSitus-BSD-3-Clause.txt).
